      "message": "wip(gpu): lock version bump and heavy reach test for the gpu crate\n\nThe workspace version moved to 0.25.0 on main; the lock follows it.\nheavy::reach: camcraft-gpu has no camcraft-* dependency, so the kernel\nreaches every crate except gpu, and gpu reaches only gpu and ui.\nNot yet built or tested.\n\nRefs #2620\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
